## License Compatibility Notes

**If you plan to distribute this plugin commercially:**

1. **JUCE**: Requires a commercial license OR GPL v3 compliance
   - Purchase from: https://juce.com/juce-7-licence/

2. **librtlsdr**: GPL v2
   - Dynamic linking may allow MIT/proprietary use (consult legal)
   - Static linking requires GPL compliance

3. **Recommended approach for commercial use**:
   - Get commercial JUCE license
   - Dynamically link to librtlsdr
   - Consult with legal counsel for GPL compatibility

**For open-source/personal use:**
- This project's MIT license allows free use
- Ensure JUCE GPL v3 requirements are met (share source if distributing)
- Comply with librtlsdr GPL v2 (share source if distributing)

